+++ b/CHANGELOG_UWX.md
@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.9-rc18 — Member view vs staff view
+
+UWX now shows each person what they can actually use, based only on what the servers say:
+- **Member** (default): lobby, friend invites with messages, Event Mode for your own hangouts, OSC Lab, People, Safety Intel (warnings + reporting), System.
+- **Group staff** (your VRChat role in a group can moderate or invite): adds group invites/recruiting (only if your role can invite), the Groups tab (only for groups you can moderate), audit log, staff & recruiting, Discord alerts, and group status on the Lobby.
+- **UnderWeb staff** (signed in to UnderWeb and confirmed by the server): adds label publishing/removal and the review queue.
+- A badge next to the version shows which view you're in (hover for details). Staff tools are hidden, not greyed out, and appear automatically when your role allows.
+- Hiding is only the view — VRChat and the UnderWeb server still enforce every action.
+
 ## 0.5.8-rc17 — Live lobby board
 
 Command → **Lobby**: everyone in your instance at a glance.
